      "value": "B-SA - BACnet Smart Actuator"
    },
    "productDescription": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "A minimal BACnet/IP actuating device built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents three commandable output objects (Analog Output, Binary Output, Multi-State Output) and three read-only input objects (Analog Input, Binary Input, Multi-State Input) that report what a simulated valve, relay and drive did with the winning command. It answers ReadProperty for every required property of every object, accepts WriteProperty to the outputs' Present_Value (refusing values out of range), reports a disconnected valve through Analog Output 1's Reliability and the FAULT bit of Status_Flags, and is discoverable by Who-Is / I-Am and Who-Has / I-Have. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-SA profile."
    },
    "productName": {
      "provenance": "user-entered",
      "value": "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-SA"
    },
